	"data": "Cyberspace V1 — Development Tree\n\nA quest log for building a persistent digital home. Four tracks, parallel paths, clear deliverables. Pick a track, start a phase, ship something.\n\nHow to Read This Document\n\nThis is a development pathway, not a task list. The work is organized into four parallel tracks — independent paths that can be worked on simultaneously. Each track has phases that build on each other sequentially, but the tracks themselves are mostly independent.\n\nDependencies between…",
